@ framework/player: every player model (code/framework/player_models.cpp). Mods
@ register listeners (modbase/player_models.h) instead of hooking these themselves.

@ PlayerModel::PlayerModel (6 args; the 4th, the forced mode, is -1 for players).
@ Entry: push {r4-r8, lr}.
PlayerModels_ctor:
    type:       hook
    address:    0x0078C444
    symbol:     ModBase::playerModels::ctor(void*, void*, int, int, int, int)
    trampoline: ModBase::playerModels::ctor_orig(void*, void*, int, int, int, int)

@ PlayerModel::draw (every character's model): body +0x018, then head +0x124.
@ Entry: push {r4, lr}.
PlayerModels_draw:
    type:       hook
    address:    0x0078E574
    symbol:     ModBase::playerModels::draw(void*)
    trampoline: ModBase::playerModels::draw_orig(void*)
